# Inventory v2

- Monorepo: `backend/` + `frontend/` + `mobile/`.
- Stack: NestJS, TypeScript strict, Prisma 7, PostgreSQL (external server via env; MySQL zadržan kao backup/rollback — vidi migracija-mysql-postgres.md).
- Frontend: React 19, Vite, Tailwind 4, BS default i18n.
- Mobile: Expo 58, React Native, Android-only (`top.ba101.evidens`), API `https://api.evidens.ba101.top`.
- Deploy: `evidens.ba101.top` (web), `api.evidens.ba101.top` (API, bez `/backend` prefiksa).
- Plan: `.cursor/plans/inventory-v2/` — plan-first for multi-phase work.
- Matrices: `.cursor/docs/matrices/*/MATRIX.md` — update on logic changes.
- Settings: novi modul/feature ⇒ registry + enforcement + matrica (vidi `settings-registry.mdc`).
- Secrets: never commit `.env`; user fills DATABASE_* and JWT_SECRET.
- Realtime: Socket.IO za notifikacije/postavke; `notifications.realtime` isključuje socket (polling ostaje).
